                "text": "I'm grateful for the continued trust and support of the people of Northern California. I'm ready to keep fighting to strengthen our economy, secure our borders, restore the health of our forests, and bring real prosperity back to America. I am excited to have President Trump back in the White House and a Senate majority to work with.  Let's get to work!",
