                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The federal government is shut down because Democrats refused to pass the House\u2019s clean 7-week funding bill. Instead, they pushed their own partisan plan that had nothing to do with keeping the government open.\n\nHere\u2019s what Democrats demanded:\n\u2013 Restoring taxpayer-funded health care for illegal aliens\n\u2013 $500 million to prop up liberal news programs\n\u2013 Prioritizing electric vehicles in HOV lanes, regardless of occupancy\n\u2013 Removing work requirements for able-bodied adults on taxpayer-funded health programs\n\u2013 Resuming DEI projects in foreign countries\n\u2013 Over $1 billion more in taxpayer-funded defense for criminals\n\u2013 Repealing $50 billion in rural health care funding, hurting hospitals and clinics\n\u2013 Rescinding border security measures passed through the Working Families Tax Cuts\n\u2013 Usurping the President\u2019s authority over emergency funds\n\u2013 Locking in Biden-era grant policies to override President Trump\u2019s executive orders\n\u2013 $1.5 trillion in new spending for just 7 weeks of funding\n\nHouse Republicans kept our bill simple and focused on keeping things running. Democrats chose to walk away and force a shutdown over their wish list.",
